# Instructions vesktop/vencord (discord) matugen theme
1. Drop into '~/.config/matugen/templates/midnight-discord.css'

2. '~/.config/matugen/config.toml' and add:

[templates.discord]
input_path = '~/.config/matugen/templates/midnight-discord.css'
output_path = '~/.var/app/dev.vencord.Vesktop/config/vesktop/themes/midnight.theme.css'

3. Enable the theme in vesktop/vencord.
the theme you will put in this folder here = '~/.var/app/dev.vencord.Vesktop/config/vesktop/themes/'
